data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"id":"ig_040622a15accc21f016a0424413ac081919bf26d180b5b6ead","type":"image_generation_call","status":"generating","action":"edit","background":"opaque","output_format":"png","quality":"medium","result":"","revised_prompt":"Edit the provided image using it as the exact visual reference for canvas size, portrait card proportions, rounded-corner playing-card silhouette, front-facing flat orthographic composition, and solid magenta background. Redesign it into a richer game-ready mystery item card sprite in pixel-art-inspired style. Keep the full card fully inside the canvas with a generous flat magenta margin on all sides. Background must be 100% solid flat #FF00FF only, with no gradients, no texture, no shadows outside the card.\n\nCard face: warm ivory white, crisp black outer border, subtle pixel shading, and a decorative inner frame made from dark ink lines with small antique-gold corner accents. Centered on the card, place exactly one large readable question mark symbol only. The question mark should have a thick black core, clean pixel-stepped silhouette, a thin antique-gold outline, and a soft blue-violet glow contained entirely on the card face. Behind it, add a restrained magical mystery motif: tiny star sparkles, small arcane dots, and a faint circular aura, all flat icon-like, subtle, and contained inside the card.\n\nDo not add suit symbols, corner rank markers, numbers, letters, words, extra readable text, watermark, hand, table, perspective tilt, or any cropped ornament. No cast shadow outside the card. Maintain clean pixel-art-inspired edges and a polished sprite look.","size":"1024x1536"},"output_index":1,"sequence_number":10}

